<title>USA: Midwest Bancshares Inc net falls.</title>
<headline>Midwest Bancshares Inc net falls.</headline>
<dateline>BURLINGTON, Iowa 1997-01-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>1996			1995</p>
<p> Shr			  $0.76		    $1.41</p>
<p> Net			    281			553</p>
<p>	  12 MONTHS</p>
<p> Shr			  $1.68		    $3.39</p>
<p> Net			    630		    1,350</p>
<p>(All data above 000s except per share numbers)</p>
<p>NOTE: Fourth quarter 1995 earnings include a one-time pretax gain of $493,000 from the sale of deposits.</p>
<p>NOTE: Figures for the 12 months ended December 31, 1996 include a one-time pretax SAIF charge of about $671,000.</p>
<p>NOTE: As of December 31, 1996, the company had 349,379 shares outstanding.</p>
<p>Total assets = $136.43 million versus $132.96 million</p>
<p>Deposits = $101.92 million versus $101.33 million</p>
<p>Loans = $24 million versus $20.5 million</p>
